WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.769
Open Expenses from Home and choose Scan receipt. Photograph the full receipt or

00:05.769 --> 00:11.410
choose a photo. Include the item lines and total. You can enter an expense manually

00:11.410 --> 00:11.953
instead.

00:15.400 --> 00:20.842
Compare the store, amount and currency with the original receipt. Review the item

00:20.842 --> 00:26.485
names, quantities and prices. Scanning and optional AI can make mistakes, so correct

00:26.485 --> 00:28.231
the details before saving.

00:30.400 --> 00:36.293
Tap Add all for eligible items, or choose individual item cards. Use Clear selection

00:36.293 --> 00:41.976
to start again. Select only food you keep at home, and check quantities for those

00:41.976 --> 00:42.397
items.

00:45.400 --> 00:50.763
Tap Save receipt to review your choices. Choose Save and update pantry for selected

00:50.763 --> 00:56.190
items, or Save without inventory to record the purchase without adding stock. Always

00:56.190 --> 00:57.676
check the final amount.
